WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.201
-Julianne,
we've known each other --

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.703
I've known you for years.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.204
You've been a famous actress
for many years,

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:08.007
but you used to have
an entirely different career.

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:10.243
You used to be a lawyer.
-Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.677
Yeah, that's right,
back in the '90s, yeah.

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:12.845
-Yeah, and a lot of people
don't know this,

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:15.047
but I was a lawyer, as well.
-Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:17.884
-And we actually worked
at the same law firm

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.385
before breaking
into entertainment.

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:20.820
-Well, yeah, it's kind of --

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.823
It's where we made our acting
debuts, you know, in a way.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.092
Do you remember -- remember
those commercials we'd shoot?

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.627
-I don't.
-No?

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.096
-No.
-Think about it.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.431
-Of course I remember them.
Are you kidding me?

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:32.732
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.367
It was the first time being
on camera for both of us.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.703
So to keep
our line readings fresh,

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.640
we wouldn't see the lines
until while we were shooting.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.875
We just read them
off the cue cards.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.108
-Right.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:44.577
-And you could really tell
that we didn't rehearse.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.245
-Mm.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:47.379
-Well, guess what.

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:48.614
I actually found
one of our old commercials.

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:49.748
-[ Gasps ]
No.

00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:51.417
-So, here for
the first time in decades,

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:55.055
one of our ads for the law
offices of Moore &amp; Fallon.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.524
Take a look.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.326
-The law offices of
Moore &amp; Fallon

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:03.663
will fight for you to get you
the help you deserve.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.197
♪♪

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:07.333
-At Moore &amp; Fallon...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.402
...we'll take on your case
and make sure you win.

00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:12.905
Fighting a speeding ticket?
No problem.

00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:14.274
Just don't pay it.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:18.411
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.879
That's what I did.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.714
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.816
And all that happened
was that I went to jail.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:26.819
[ Laughter ]
[ Gavel bangs ]

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:30.222
-Hey, you want to sue
the Cheesecake Factory?

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:33.192
We'll sue the Cheesecake Factory
for $20 million.

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:34.593
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:38.130
'Cause last time I checked,
that place isn't a factory.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.100
It's a restaurant.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.935
Get it together, idiots.

00:01:42.935 --> 00:01:45.238
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.740
-Have you or a loved one
suffered after being bitten

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.709
by Maroon 5 singer Adam Levine?

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.711
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.948
How did that even happen?
Why would he bite you?

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:56.181
I need --

00:01:56.181 --> 00:02:01.654
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:05.224
-If you need legal help,
log on to our website now

00:02:05.224 --> 00:02:09.395
at www.mooreandfallon.com/

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:16.201
newcases/formsnewemail.com

00:02:16.201 --> 00:02:18.003
dot gov dot law

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:26.613
4799999999999
dot law.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.247
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:31.217
-Have you ever been injured?
-Do you need help?

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.419
-What's the deal with air--
airline food?

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:34.787
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.490
-Why do we park in the driveway
but drive in the parkway?

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.226
-We have so many questions, but
we don't know how Google works.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.295
-It's conf--
It's confusing!

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:50.837
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.172
-My parents thought
I was gonna be a twin.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:55.908
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.908 --> 00:02:58.310
And it turns out I was just
a super chubby baby.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.745
[ Gavel bangs ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.745 --> 00:03:03.416
-Me big lawyer.
Me make big-time money.

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:06.018
Me throw money in trash.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.018 --> 00:03:10.123
Trash can rich now.
I make trash can money.

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:12.158
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:14.794
-Remember that lady who spilled
McDonald's coffee on herself

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.696
and then got a bunch of money
for it?

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.464
We were the lawyers
for McDonald's.

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:22.167
Not really.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:22.167 --> 00:03:24.803
-Wha--
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:25.972
-I'm a little bit country.

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.340
-And I'm a little bit
rock 'n' roll.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.475
-Which is why
we wrote this jingle.

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:30.476
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:33.579
-Oh, no.
[ Laughing ]

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:37.016
-♪ Moore and Fallon ♪
♪ Moore and Fallon ♪

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:39.618
♪ We charge
a hundred bucks an hour ♪

00:03:39.618 --> 00:03:42.421
♪ But we only accept Bitcoin ♪

00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:44.590
-When was this?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.558
-The law offices
of Moore &amp; Fallon.

00:03:46.558 --> 00:03:49.628
Call now.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:49.628 --> 00:03:53.399
-Wow. We --
-Yeah.

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:54.767
I --
-We instantly went bankrupt.

00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:56.102
-I can't believe it.

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:57.837
-Also that we knew
what Bitcoin was in the '90s.

00:03:57.837 --> 00:03:59.038
-I know.
-And Google.

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:00.707
-And Google.
-My thanks to Julianne Moore.

